{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1423818-aberrant-talents-and-quantum-tech","id":1423818,"title":"[Aberrant] Talents and Quantum-Tech","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aberrant"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-11-14T13:54:51-08:00","id":1423818,"title":"[Aberrant] Talents and Quantum-Tech","content":"As stated in the book, to use Quantum-tech is necessary:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <i>\u201cQ-tech \u2014 requires a nova to be able to function. Q-tech interacts with a nova\u2019s quantum imprint at a fundamental level to be able to function at all. Non-nova study of Q-tech can barely make any sense of how it works, even for apparently simple objects.\u201d </i><i>(Trinity Continuum Aberrant- pg. 229)</i> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <i>\u201cPut simply, Q-tech requires a nova to power it be*cause every piece of Q-tech replicates the workings of nova powers. Even when a nova power performs a function that can be achieved in non-nova ways, the power itself channels quantum flux to manipu*late the raw fundamental forces of creation to cre*ate its effect. When using Q-tech, a nova channels flux through the technology to replicate the effect of a power, regardless of the appearance or com*plexity of the technology. (...) </i><i><b>Without a nova to provide the quantum flux to power the technology, it\u2019s essen*tially just inert junk</b></i><i>.\u201d </i><i>(Trinity Continuum Aberrant- pg. 232)</i> </div> </div> </div>However, on page 240 it states that Talents manage to use Quantum-Tech even for a few moments:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <i>\u201cTalents can also attempt this, spending a point of Inspiration and rolling their Intuitive facet instead of Quantum. If successful, the character can use the device as would a nova, spending Inspiration in place of Quantum points. Psiads can\u2019t attempt to use Q-tech at all.\u201d </i><i>(Trinity Continuum Aberrant- pg. 240)</i> </div> </div> </div>If Quantum-Flux is different from Talents-Flux, it seems inconsistent that Talents can use such technology, despite the fact that Talents manage to bend reality to their will, using their Talent-Flux. But not all \u201cluck\u201d (Intuitive Facet) in the world will make a Talent produce Quantum-Imprint and neither Quantum flux, which according to pages 229 and 232 is the fuel for this type of device. Which brings my question to everyone (and Devs):<br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>How can a Talent, without Quantum-Flux or Quantum-Imprint, manage to use Quantum-Tech?</b></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26537,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26537-jonnes-derik","user":"Jonnes.Derik","date":". 11-14-2020, 05:34 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26537-jonnes-derik","name":"Jonnes.Derik","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26537_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-14T14:03:41-08:00","id":1423823,"title":"","content":"A Talent don\u2019t Attune to Q-Tech, but it can to \u201cforce it to work\u201d once maybe twice.<br /> <br /> The point is, Talents are not normal people, they can handle some kind of energy, and a very versatile one. It\u2019s not the most effective (or even conscious) way to handle energy, as it open a breach in the universe and let a bit of quantum energy to flow in, powering the item. Or maybe he is ABSOLUTELY lucky and there is the last bit of energy stored that just happens to power it up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-14T16:52:09-08:00","id":1423877,"title":"","content":"hmmm ... strange ...I didn't like this so much..and again, opens the question Talent have anything to do with Quantum-Flux. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> It\u2019s not the most effective (or even conscious) way to handle energy, as it open a breach in the universe and let a bit of quantum energy to flow in, powering the item. </div> </div> </div>It may be a solution. <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Or maybe he is ABSOLUTELY lucky and there is the last bit of energy stored that just happens to power it up. </div> </div> </div>But I still think there are many assumptions in those explanations. Another fact is that Talents are virtually undetectable, see the little progress of the Tantalus project. The use of Quantum-tech by humans without MR-coin would be an extremely easy way to detect Talents, which in my opinion is inconsistent with the Talent's lowprofilling metaplot. The same problem with the Gift \u201cBehold the Halo\u201d from pag.201 of Trinity Continuum Core.<br /> <br /> <b>In fact, I find the fact that Talents can use Quantum-Tech quite random and arbitrary. Not making sense with the game's Lore.</b><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26537-jonnes-derik","name":"Jonnes.Derik","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26537_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-14T17:14:14-08:00","id":1423885,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jonnes.Derik</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1423818-aberrant-talents-and-quantum-tech?p=1423877#post1423877\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <b>In fact, I find the fact that Talents can use Quantum-Tech quite random and arbitrary. Not making sense with the game's Lore.</b><br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Talents are kind of random and arbitrary. They deal with probability and &quot;the art of the possible.&quot; Is it possible that there's a little Q-juice left in the tank of the Q-thingie to make it work? <b>Possibly</b>.<br /> <br /> Does that mean that after they beat him, one could use the Inseminoid's Death-Sperm gun to &quot;depregnify&quot; the area to keep the ladies there from birthing evil hentai tentacle monsters? Hopefully. Can they then add the Death-Sperm gun to their permanent arsenal (why would you, you vile creep)? No.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2318,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","user":"johntfs","date":". 11-14-2020, 08:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-14T17:18:51-08:00","id":1423886,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jonnes.Derik</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1423818-aberrant-talents-and-quantum-tech?p=1423877#post1423877\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <b>In fact, I find the fact that Talents can use Quantum-Tech quite random and arbitrary. Not making sense with the game's Lore.</b><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> </div> </div> </div> </div>The game\u2019s lore is meant to facilitate genre tropes. People in setting do not have a perfect understanding of the metaphysics, so the fact that some baselines get lucky a minority of the time and get Q-tech to briefly work might be an observable phenomena, but it is hardly consistent enough to provide a reliable test for Talents, nor can those who hypothesize Talents\u2019 existence be sure those categories perfectly overlap.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-14T17:26:59-08:00","id":1423890,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>johntfs</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1423818-aberrant-talents-and-quantum-tech?p=1423885#post1423885\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does that mean that after they beat him, one could use the Inseminoid's Death-Sperm gun to &quot;depregnify&quot; the area to keep the ladies there from birthing evil hentai tentacle monsters? Hopefully. Can they then add the Death-Sperm gun to their permanent arsenal (why would you, you vile creep)? No.</div> </div> </div> </div>This one was a awesome... thanks dor the laugh!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-14T17:35:01-08:00","id":1423893,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mateus Luz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1423818-aberrant-talents-and-quantum-tech?p=1423890#post1423890\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This one was a awesome... thanks dor the laugh!</div> </div> </div> </div>It's Aberrant. The hometime of Duke Rollo. If you're not doing weird, crazy Super-people, you're doing it wrong.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-14T17:41:36-08:00","id":1423898,"title":"","content":"Actually, Death-Sperm Gun is something very pulp, at least a porn parody of pulp.<br /> <br /> Miss Boobarella versus the Death-Sperm Gun","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-14T18:22:52-08:00","id":1423903,"title":"","content":"Gentlemen, thank you very much for your feedback. And I ask you to forgive me for any possible lack of understanding of the game and its tropes. (and also my bad English).<br /> <br /> My understanding is: The Quantum device in contact with Nova, is loaded in real time, with QUANTUM-FLUX that allows QUANTUM-TECH to function, that is, far from a QUANTUM-FLUX source, this technology simply does not work, agreement as indicated on page 232 of the Trinity Continuum Aberrant.<br /> <br /> That said, I find Mateus Luz's solution interesting, of possibly Q-tech having some Quantum-Flux stored. However, it has the following assumption and repercussions.<br /> 1- If Quantum-tech can store quantum-flux, then it is possible for any baseline to use this device, as long as it is loaded, which the book says is impossible to use by baselines.<br /> <br /> <br /> If Talent, when accessing Talent-Flux opens a hole in reality through which it can go through Quantum-flux.<br /> 2- It results in a direct relationship between Talents and Quantum flux, which we already know does not exist.<br /> <br /> <br /> Obs: In the book there is the rule of use for a Nova Unattuned with the device. I believe that use is only possible because the nova in question has Quantum-flux, thus loading the weapon in real time.<br /> <br /> Gentlemen, once again I thank you for your efforts to enlighten me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26537,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26537-jonnes-derik","user":"Jonnes.Derik","date":". 11-14-2020, 09:25 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26537-jonnes-derik","name":"Jonnes.Derik","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26537_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-14T18:41:53-08:00","id":1423908,"title":"","content":"Also, it's worth noting that in Aeon, psions have a whole set of powers that let them manipulate quantum with psi, and aberrants can get a power that lets them imitate psi with quantum. So it makes sense that talents could find ways to imitate psi or quantum for certain situations.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1711-zeea","name":"Zeea","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-14T18:49:52-08:00","id":1423910,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zeea</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1423818-aberrant-talents-and-quantum-tech?p=1423908#post1423908\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">and aberrants can get a power that lets them imitate psi with quantum.</div> </div> </div> </div>When did that happen?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-14T19:07:50-08:00","id":1423911,"title":"","content":"TC:\u00c6 p.336: Mode Analog.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-14T19:09:22-08:00","id":1423912,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1423818-aberrant-talents-and-quantum-tech?p=1423910#post1423910\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> When did that happen?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Mode Analog mutation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1711-zeea","name":"Zeea","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-14T19:19:52-08:00","id":1423913,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jonnes.Derik</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1423818-aberrant-talents-and-quantum-tech?p=1423903#post1423903\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If Talent, when accessing Talent-Flux opens a hole in reality through which it can go through Quantum-flux.<br /> 2- It results in a direct relationship between Talents and Quantum flux, which we already know does not exist.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not really. A Talent using their Inspiration to activate a Nova device is the same as using Dramatic Editing to say, &quot;there is a trap door hidden under the rug.&quot; It may not have previously been true in the game's universe, but it was true somewhere, and the Talent imposed that truth onto the world. Some version of the Nova device in some distant alternate reality may have been firing at that moment, so the Talent forced the local version to fire.<br /> <br /> Talent-Flux is a matter of manipulating weak points between dimensions to pull properties from elsewhere. Since quantum-flux is a thing that exists, it is a thing that can be affected by those manipulations, just like everything else. This gives quantum-flux the same exact relationship with Talent-flux as everything else that exists.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25506-shepherdboi","name":"Shepherdboi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25506_1.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"364"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-14T19:28:13-08:00","id":1423914,"title":"","content":"It\u00b4s correct! By using Quantakinesis. The psicomorph, creates a kind of sub-quantum sleeve to reach the quantum realm.<br /> <br /> \u200b<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Also, it's worth noting that in Aeon, psions have a whole set of powers that let them manipulate quantum with psi, </div> </div> </div>So, I don't think so. As I understand it, Quantum Powers operates in the Quantum realm, using the 4 forces: Gravity, Weak Nuclear Force, Strong Nuclear Force and electromagnetism.<br /> Psi works at a lower level, in the Subquantico realm, which would be the blueprint of the infrastructure of reality. Exomorphs (Starwarts, Novas and Aberrants) do not have access to the Sub-Quantum Kingdom. As the book says on page 165 of Aberrant's book.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <i>\u201cNovas are creatures of the Quantum, and the Sub-quantum is forever beyond them.\u201d</i> Trinity Continuum Aberrant -pag.165 </div> </div> </div>What happens is that some effects are Quantum and Sub-Quantum are similar on a more superficial level. But the nature of the power source is (almost) irreconcilable.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> \u201cand aberrants can get a power that lets them imitate psi with quantum.\u201d </div> </div> </div>I really REALLY don\u00b4t think (WANT) so... ^^<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> So it makes sense that talents could find ways to imitate psi or quantum for certain situations. </div> </div> </div><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26537,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26537-jonnes-derik","user":"Jonnes.Derik","date":". 11-14-2020, 11:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26537-jonnes-derik","name":"Jonnes.Derik","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26537_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-14T19:28:16-08:00","id":1423915,"title":"","content":"Also: it's worth noting that while we've been comparing it to a kind of energy, Talent-Flux (or, as I recently suggested calling it, Potential) <i>isn't</i> a kind of energy; at least, not in the way Quantum and Psi are. You'll note that QK has <i>no effect</i> on Talents: Subquantum Sense doesn't detect them or their workings; and Fundamentals don't resist, shield, drain, manipulate, or transfer a Talent's Inspiration or Gifts.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-14T19:35:46-08:00","id":1423916,"title":"","content":"Very very Interesting!<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Some version of the Nova device in some distant alternate reality may have been firing at that moment, so the Talent forced the local version to fire. </div> </div> </div>But dramatic editing only changes unstated facts.<br /> Ex. If someone saw an open window, and this fact is consolidated, the dramatic editing cannot keep a closed window.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> &quot;The edit can\u2019t overrule facts that have previously been established in the setting or override the effects of a dice roll that have already occurred.&quot; Trinity Continuum Core, p. 154. </div> </div> </div>In this specific case it is a FACT that Quantum-tech only works with Quantum-flux.<br /> <br /> I think that dramatic editing could not change this fact.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26537,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26537-jonnes-derik","user":"Jonnes.Derik","date":". 11-14-2020, 11:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26537-jonnes-derik","name":"Jonnes.Derik","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26537_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-14T19:39:26-08:00","id":1423917,"title":"","content":"I Agree !!<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Also: it's worth noting that while we've been comparing it to a kind of energy, Talent-Flux (or, as I recently suggested calling it, Potential) <i>isn't</i> a kind of energy; at least, not in the way Quantum and Psi are. You'll note that QK has <i>no effect</i> on Talents: Subquantum Sense doesn't detect them or their workings; and Fundamentals don't resist, shield, drain, manipulate, or transfer a Talent's Inspiration or Gifts. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26537-jonnes-derik","name":"Jonnes.Derik","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26537_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-14T20:17:43-08:00","id":1423924,"title":"","content":"Potential can be energy, but the same way Psi is out of the reach of Quantum, Potential is out of reach of Psi because it is not in the universe, but in the between universes.<br /> Novas accumulate quantum energy in their bodies, and it distorts their bodies in the process in the form of Quantum Flux.<br /> Psi has no issue, as the energy is stored in the sun quantum space, in the Psionic lattice that describes the psion self.<br /> Potential is stored out of the Talent body, in the between of the many versions of himself, so out of the universe.<br /> <br /> Maybe a Quantakinetic or virtually any super human can drain Potential of a Talent, but only after the potential enters the universe, otherwise it don\u2019t exist in that reality to start with. The problem is, and that\u2019s why I think potential is a great name, once it is in the universe, it\u2019s not potential any more, it becomes... part of the reality, the result of the gift or dramatic edition.<br /> <br /> At least that is what happens when a Talent uses it. Jump to my babies, the Excelsiors and their capacity some of them have to handle Potential in its brute form. Maybe (and I say maybe because I didn\u2019t think about it too much... but as the creator I can just make it be, if you guys like it) a Quantakinetic could detect Potential in its brute form in reality, while an Excelsior hold it as potential, and identify it as a 3rd kind of energy that they don\u2019t feel when Talents handle it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-14T20:38:33-08:00","id":1423928,"title":"","content":"I have always thought about the relationship between Talent-flux (Potential) with the universe and its relationship with the other two forces (Psi and Quantum). After reading and rereading I found this here:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> &quot;Inspiration is the flux that surrounds a Talent, fills her, and lets her tap into energy that allows her to perform extraordinary feats.&quot; Trinity Continuum Core Pag. 151 </div> </div> </div>In the same way that a nova is a Quantum-flux battery. A Talent is a Talent-Flux battery.<br /> A Psicomorph would be a bender of the material reality template.<br /> <br /> In my opinion, Talent-Flux does exist between worlds, but in flux-events it leaks into our reality, and these leaks inspire Talent and allow his connections to other universes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26537,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26537-jonnes-derik","user":"Jonnes.Derik","date":". 11-15-2020, 12:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26537-jonnes-derik","name":"Jonnes.Derik","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26537_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-14T21:03:16-08:00","id":1423929,"title":"","content":"Psions are benders, but they spend energy stored in their noetic body to bend reality, same way Novas spend Quantum energy stored in their physical bodies. Talents are storing energy in their bodies, but not in their physical or even noetic bodies, but in their projections into the Myst.<br /> The potential field around a talent is energy, it is hidden in the myst, same way psi is hidden in the subquantum.<br /> <br /> when it leaks into reality it probably is mensurable and maybe even controled by quantakinesis, but it\u2019s really rare and usually turns into something, like a change in reality, a portal to another reality or a change in the persons around (that become talents).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":24985,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","user":"Mateus Luz","date":". 11-15-2020, 12:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-14T21:31:23-08:00","id":1423930,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zeea</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1423818-aberrant-talents-and-quantum-tech?p=1423912#post1423912\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The Mode Analog mutation.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah, from TC: Aeon for Aberrant NPCs. That\u2019s not a power that lets them imitate psi with quantum. That\u2019s a system hack to let NPCs produce psi-like effects so the Storyguide can say \u2018yes, this one shoots lightning like a Photokinesis effect\u2019. And it has nothing to do with PC novas.<br /> <br /> In the prime Continuum, psi can have some manipulation of Quantum via Quantakinesis, Quantum can\u2019t manipulate psi.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-14T21:40:25-08:00","id":1423931,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jonnes.Derik</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1423818-aberrant-talents-and-quantum-tech?p=1423903#post1423903\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Gentlemen, thank you very much for your feedback.</div> </div> </div> </div>Intended in the spirit of helpfulness, there are many people of various genders contributing here so please take care to not use gendered or exclusionist terminology when interacting.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jonnes.Derik</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1423818-aberrant-talents-and-quantum-tech?p=1423903#post1423903\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> If Talent, when accessing Talent-Flux opens a hole in reality through which it can go through Quantum-flux.<br /> 2- It results in a direct relationship between Talents and Quantum flux, which we already know does not exist.</div> </div> </div> </div>You\u2019re overthinking it. Talents can have the one-off uses of Q-tech because they can. That\u2019s it. It\u2019s the dramatic moment when someone unable to use the magic technology device manages to get the single shot off and save the day, or disrupt the villain\u2019s plans, or whatever. It\u2019s the dramatically appropriate thing because Talents run on dramatically appropriate moments. There\u2019s no science behind it, no one could ever say it\u2019s because a nova used it in a parallel dimension or whatever. They\u2019re not powering it, there\u2019s no relationship between their Inspiration and a nova\u2019s Quantum Flux. <br /> <br /> It\u2019s just a thing they can do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-14T22:17:24-08:00","id":1423936,"title":"","content":"Oh ... my bad ... You are totally correct. I'll be careful with that.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Intended in the spirit of helpfulness, there are many people of various genders contributing here so please take care to not use gendered or exclusionist terminology when interacting. </div> </div> </div>Unfortunately, this is not a satisfactory reason/solution for me, but thank you very much for the feedback.<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Talents can have the one-off uses of Q-tech because they can. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26537,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26537-jonnes-derik","user":"Jonnes.Derik","date":". 11-15-2020, 01:35 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26537-jonnes-derik","name":"Jonnes.Derik","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26537_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-14T22:27:15-08:00","id":1423937,"title":"","content":"I totally agree with that.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Ah, from TC: Aeon for Aberrant NPCs. That\u2019s not a power that lets them imitate psi with quantum. That\u2019s a system hack to let NPCs produce psi-like effects so the Storyguide can say \u2018yes, this one shoots lightning like a Photokinesis effect\u2019. And it has nothing to do with PC novas.<br /> <br /> In the prime Continuum, psi can have some manipulation of Quantum via Quantakinesis, Quantum can\u2019t manipulate psi. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26537-jonnes-derik","name":"Jonnes.Derik","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26537_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"74"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-14T23:35:47-08:00","id":1423942,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jonnes.Derik</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1423818-aberrant-talents-and-quantum-tech?p=1423936#post1423936\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Unfortunately, this is not a satisfactory reason/solution for me, but thank you very much for the feedback.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fair enough. You\u2019re welcome to invent your own explanations of course, but the \u2018it\u2019s just a thing\u2019 is what happens.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-15T03:00:08-08:00","id":1423971,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jonnes.Derik</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1423818-aberrant-talents-and-quantum-tech?p=1423936#post1423936\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Unfortunately, this is not a satisfactory reason/solution for me, but thank you very much for the feedback.</div> </div> </div> </div>Then just don't allow it in your game. It's not like Bunyip and Ian are going to come to your house with the Game Police and kick your ass. If something doesn't work for you, just change it. There's another thread about Psiads having Teleportation as a Primary Aptitude, which can't be a thing according to the Rules As Written.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1423818-aberrant-talents-and-quantum-tech?p=1423942#post1423942\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Fair enough. You\u2019re welcome to invent your own explanations of course, but the \u2018it\u2019s just a thing\u2019 is what happens.</div> </div> </div> </div>What I'm kind of getting is that there's a kind of inverse relationship between &quot;range&quot; or &quot;potential effect&quot; and power. Novas can't do Dramatic Editing or even indirectly use Psi but in terms of sheer power they can potentially create universes. Psis can potentially indirectly manipulate quantum but can't really use it nearly as potently as true Novas and also can't manipulate Inspiration. Talents can potentially use Dramatic Editing to manipulate/use anything - but only on a fairly specific case-by-case basis and will never have the raw power of Novas or even Psiads.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2318,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","user":"johntfs","date":".  typos 11-15-2020, 06:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-15T08:05:51-08:00","id":1424014,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>johntfs</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1423818-aberrant-talents-and-quantum-tech?p=1423971#post1423971\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Then just don't allow it in your game. It's not like Bunyip and Ian are going to come to your house with the Game Police and kick your ass. If something doesn't work for you, just change it. There's another thread about Psiads having Teleportation as a Primary Aptitude, which can't be a thing according to the Rules As Written.</div> </div> </div> </div>I beg to differ. One time I changed how Mega-Stamina worked and, well, it took six weeks for all the broken bones to heal.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1711-zeea","name":"Zeea","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"106"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-15T08:17:21-08:00","id":1424016,"title":"","content":"If Mega-Stamina doesn't prevent broken bones, it needs work.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-15T09:04:02-08:00","id":1424019,"title":"","content":"I think I get it. In <b>Mateus' Luz 1st paradigm</b> (I'll call it &quot;<b>Potential Paradigm</b>&quot;), Potential is <i>not </i>an energy per se, but an actual &quot;difference of potential&quot; in the Physical Science sense (such as &quot;10 Volts&quot; between two different poles of a wire) that does <i>not</i> exist inside the universe (it's merely the measure of difference between &quot;our universe&quot; and &quot;another&quot;); in <b>Jonnes' paradigm </b>(I'll call it &quot;<b>Energy Paradigm</b>&quot;) Talent-Flux is akin to some kind of material energy (such as &quot;10 Coulombs&quot;) that <i>does </i>exist inside the Talent's body. In <b>Mateus' 2nd paradigm</b> (I'll call it &quot;<b>Excelsior Paradigm</b>&quot;) is an alternate version of the Potential Paradigm: in this version, the <i>Excelsior's body does contain</i> actual Potential Energy (such as a &quot;10 Volts&quot; battery).<br /> <br /> I think both (or &quot;three-both&quot;?) solve the problem about Paramorph metaphysics, <i>but I think the choosing criteria of which one to use should be which paradigm explains perfectly everything we see in-game and in-systems</i>. <b>If none can be perfect, then we should list the Pros and Cons of each, and then make an informed decision about which one to use as &quot;truth</b>&quot;. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> <br /> <br /> I think the Potential Paradigm is very elegant and my instincts tell me it fits the world perfectly, but since I did not think about all of the emergent consequences of it, I cannot say (yet) that I'll use it.<br /> <br /> The Energy Paradigm's main good points, for me, is that it has a high usability (I'm not sure average Joe grasps what &quot;Potential&quot; means in physics), and if I'm not mistaken, is also the one the official books use.<br /> <br /> I don't know if I like the &quot;Detectable/Stealable&quot; energy feature of the Excelsior Paradigm, but my gut feeling tells me it's not a good choice - but I can be wrong, I should think much more about it.<br /> <br /> Despite all that, congratulations to Mateus and Jonnes, your thoughts are really interesting!!!<br /> (Oh, and I bought your Fists of Flux book Mateus, really liked the Excelsior concept. Reminded me a lot of MCU's Doctor Strange!)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1001-timecrafter","name":"Timecrafter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1001_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-15T09:14:11-08:00","id":1424022,"title":"","content":"Err\u2026 the \u201cPotential Paradigm\u201d, as you put it, is mine.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-15T09:57:21-08:00","id":1424036,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1423818-aberrant-talents-and-quantum-tech?p=1424022#post1424022\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Err\u2026 the \u201cPotential Paradigm\u201d, as you put it, is mine.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes! I just work a little on top of it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-15T11:02:15-08:00","id":1424053,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>johntfs</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1423818-aberrant-talents-and-quantum-tech?p=1423885#post1423885\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Talents are kind of random and arbitrary. They deal with probability and &amp;quot;the art of the possible.&amp;quot; Is it possible that there's a little Q-juice left in the tank of the Q-thingie to make it work? <b>Possibly</b>.<br /> <br /> Does that mean that after they beat him, one could use the Inseminoid's Death-Sperm gun to &amp;quot;depregnify&amp;quot; the area to keep the ladies there from birthing evil hentai tentacle monsters? Hopefully. Can they then add the Death-Sperm gun to their permanent arsenal (why would you, you vile creep)? No.</div> </div> </div> </div>\ud83d\ude02\ud83d\ude02\ud83d\ude02\ud83d\ude02<br /> <br /> OMG this made me laugh","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-15T11:19:45-08:00","id":1424057,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1423818-aberrant-talents-and-quantum-tech?p=1424022#post1424022\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Err\u2026 the \u201cPotential Paradigm\u201d, as you put it, is mine.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ok, sorry. Credits to you then <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/redface.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Embarrassment\" smilieid=\"2\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1001-timecrafter","name":"Timecrafter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1001_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"134"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-15T11:45:49-08:00","id":1424061,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1423818-aberrant-talents-and-quantum-tech?p=1423911#post1423911\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">TC:\u00c6 p.336: Mode Analog.</div> </div> </div> </div>I\u2019m pretty sure that\u2019s mechanics shorthand to cover various power concepts without Aberrant, not an in-setting ability to replicate Psi.<br /> <br /> Edit: oh Bunyip covered it","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 11-15-2020, 02:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-15T14:33:42-08:00","id":1424097,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1423818-aberrant-talents-and-quantum-tech?p=1424061#post1424061\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I\u2019m pretty sure that\u2019s mechanics shorthand to cover various power concepts without Aberrant, not an in-setting ability to replicate Psi.<br /> <br /> Edit: oh Bunyip covered it</div> </div> </div> </div>Pretty much. It's not really anything new. White Wolf used to do it all the time. You have Vampire: The Masquerade and want to run your vamps against a Mage or a Werewolf. So, they'd kludge a few of the Disciplines and powers to give you an idea what that would be like so you didn't have to drop $30.00 on a different game to get an antagonist. Or, in our case so &quot;Yes, your team has cornered the Aberrant. That battle is about to begin... in maybe a year or two when I get the Aberrant rules.&quot; wouldn't be a thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-16T11:37:30-08:00","id":1424320,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shepherdboi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1423818-aberrant-talents-and-quantum-tech?p=1423913#post1423913\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not really. A Talent using their Inspiration to activate a Nova device is the same as using Dramatic Editing to say, &quot;there is a trap door hidden under the rug.&quot; It may not have previously been true in the game's universe, but it was true somewhere, and the Talent imposed that truth onto the world. Some version of the Nova device in some distant alternate reality may have been firing at that moment, so the Talent forced the local version to fire.<br /> <br /> Talent-Flux is a matter of manipulating weak points between dimensions to pull properties from elsewhere. Since quantum-flux is a thing that exists, it is a thing that can be affected by those manipulations, just like everything else. This gives quantum-flux the same exact relationship with Talent-flux as everything else that exists.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> This is the correct answer. Talents don't just play with probabilities. They play with dimensional probabilities. Somewhere, in some dimension, the device is working at the very moment the Talent needs it to work. And they just port that dimension's reality onto their own with a little Inspiration.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Danielle Lauzon, Requiem Developer, Storypath Guru, freelance writer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6155-impernious","name":"impernious","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"37"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-18T10:08:11-08:00","id":1424764,"title":"","content":"But novas are not quantum batteries, as per 2nd ed paradigm. They channel the quantum all around us, and the quantum pools are an abstraction of how much they can pull safely, and in a controlled fashion, without taking a break.<br /> <br /> So, since quantum energies are all around us, MAYBE the quantum pseudo-random field generates itself inside the q-tech, MAYBE NOT. It'd be extremely unlikely for it to happen, a thermodynamic miracle! Someone would have to be very, very lucky for it to happen.<br /> <br /> Hence, talents can do it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1524-pcontop","name":"pcontop","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1524_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"278"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-18T18:13:41-08:00","id":1424839,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1423818-aberrant-talents-and-quantum-tech?p=1423930#post1423930\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ah, from TC: Aeon for Aberrant NPCs. That\u2019s not a power that lets them imitate psi with quantum. That\u2019s a system hack to let NPCs produce psi-like effects so the Storyguide can say \u2018yes, this one shoots lightning like a Photokinesis effect\u2019. And it has nothing to do with PC novas.<br /> <br /> In the prime Continuum, psi can have some manipulation of Quantum via Quantakinesis, Quantum can\u2019t manipulate psi.</div> </div> </div> </div>As a note, between the term confusion and the way the TC is built to encourage 'crossover' games, perhaps adding some guidelines in some supplement (perhaps Adventure!, when it comes, since you have low-level quantum, psi, and flux users all) to clear up 'what's a system hack', 'what is IC term confusion' and 'what is actually consistent between character types' is in order.<br /> <br /> As it is, in the literal rules as written a group could be forgiven for assuming Nova-era talents are swimming in Inspiration because there are so many 'flux sources' around them to recover it from.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2334-aliasi","name":"Aliasi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2334_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"197"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-18T18:30:56-08:00","id":1424843,"title":"","content":"Relax, Adventure will bring another level of confusion, with Telluric Energy, Inspiration and Knacks working for everyone.<br /> Except if not...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-18T19:26:40-08:00","id":1424857,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>pcontop</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1423818-aberrant-talents-and-quantum-tech?p=1424764#post1424764\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But novas are not quantum batteries, as per 2nd ed paradigm. They channel the quantum all around us, and the quantum pools are an abstraction of how much they can pull safely, and in a controlled fashion, without taking a break.<br /> <br /> So, since quantum energies are all around us, MAYBE the quantum pseudo-random field generates itself inside the q-tech, MAYBE NOT. It'd be extremely unlikely for it to happen, a thermodynamic miracle! Someone would have to be very, very lucky for it to happen.<br /> <br /> Hence, talents can do it.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is a real &quot;ahah, taste the soup&quot; situation and I'm all for it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7165-queen-anne-country","name":"Queen Anne Country","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"84"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-21T20:44:48-08:00","id":1425446,"title":"","content":"I have to admit I like the idea of there being a Talent Gift that lets them interface with say specifically made Quantum tech in an empowered way. This would allow for say Colonel James Rhodes to be a Talent who is able to make empowered use of the War Machine q-tech armor made for him by the Nova Tony Stark.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-21T22:51:53-08:00","id":1425464,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1423818-aberrant-talents-and-quantum-tech?p=1425446#post1425446\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have to admit I like the idea of there being a Talent Gift that lets them interface with say specifically made Quantum tech in an empowered way. This would allow for say Colonel James Rhodes to be a Talent who is able to make empowered use of the War Machine q-tech armor made for him by the Nova Tony Stark.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah I love that interpretation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-22T12:17:43-08:00","id":1425545,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1423818-aberrant-talents-and-quantum-tech?p=1425446#post1425446\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have to admit I like the idea of there being a Talent Gift that lets them interface with say specifically made Quantum tech in an empowered way. This would allow for say Colonel James Rhodes to be a Talent who is able to make empowered use of the War Machine q-tech armor made for him by the Nova Tony Stark.</div> </div> </div> </div>That\u2019s what Nova-Tech is for, and how something that starts at one tier can be made more accessible - hence Rhodie\u2019s armor is Nova-tech (Mega-Int needed to make it, but any sufficently skilled person can use it), while Tony\u2019s armor is always the current cutting edge of Q-Tech.<br /> <br /> <br /> That said, I do have a Talent Gift in my forthcoming Nexus Project, that allows a Talent to change what Q-Tech can do for the one shot they can get off with it - the Gift is called \u201cReverse the Polarity!\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 11-22-2020, 04:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-22T16:57:17-08:00","id":1425585,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aberrant/1423818-aberrant-talents-and-quantum-tech?p=1425446#post1425446\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have to admit I like the idea of there being a Talent Gift that lets them interface with say specifically made Quantum tech in an empowered way. This would allow for say Colonel James Rhodes to be a Talent who is able to make empowered use of the War Machine q-tech armor made for him by the Nova Tony Stark.</div> </div> </div> </div>Or he spent the XP he got in <i>Iron Man</i> on an Artifact 5/Wondrous Item 3 defined as the War Machine suit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2318-johntfs","name":"johntfs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"373"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}